{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102","id":5543523867,"node_id":"I_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABSmt2Gw","number":102,"title":"[PP] Repeat warning flags in the supplementary CFLAGS group for the VID fixture","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-22T18:24:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T18:35:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"[A10] PP (protocol processor) prerequisite discovered during the authorized milan-fpga #400 + #403 integration.\n\n## Objective and observed evidence\n\nMake the PP `tb/pp_top` generated-VID fixture conform to the parent warning policy without changing its fixture value or weakening any checker.\n\nAt merged donor `8452f564294300a82d56eed464276576f65f4d58`, `tb/pp_top/Makefile:59` adds `-CFLAGS \"-DPP_TOP_SRP_DOM_DEF_VID=0x$(SRP_VID_FIXTURE)\"`. The common VFLAGS includes `-Wall -Wextra`, but the parent `scripts/check_cpp_idiom.py:cflags_missing` explicitly requires both in each quoted CFLAGS group. The integrated parent gate exits 1 (`build without warnings 1 > ratchet 0`). This is a per-group policy incompatibility; it does not establish that the effective compiler invocation disabled warnings.\n\n[Original finding](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/400#issuecomment-5781426819). [Exact author evidence and failed command](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/tree/ff1ebf16263590b0cdca32a1e74ffc4195f0aa9e/review-evidence/400-403-r1/author). Donor #95 / PR #96 introduced this fixture; this new finding was not an unresolved finding of their completed review.\n\n## Authorities and scope\n\nParent CONTRIBUTING sections 2/3, `docs/development/CODE_QUALITY.md`, `scripts/check_cpp_idiom.py:cflags_missing` and its default warning-flag controls at parent dev `483a133ed08867ea0d300d2b4a027b5b48a4282f`; donor #95/#97 fixture separation contract and the actual `tb/pp_top/Makefile`.\n\nDecision: keep the existing per-group parent policy and add both warning flags to the supplementary fixture CFLAGS group. No parent checker exemption, ratchet increase, RTL change, fixture renumbering, scenario removal or generic build-system rewrite. No automatic parent pin adoption is authorized by this issue.\n\n## Acceptance and exact validation\n\n1. Every PP `tb/pp_top` CFLAGS group carries `-Wall -Wextra`; the fixture macro still receives its existing distinct `SRP_VID_FIXTURE` value.\n2. Run the immutable parent checker’s `cflags_missing` on the corrected Makefile: empty result. Apply the same checker to a disposable copy with either newly repeated flag removed: the corresponding flag is reported. Use the real checker, not a rewritten expectation.\n3. Build and execute the complete donor `tb/pp_top` suite with the pinned supported Verilator and record the exact recipe, source identity, exit and full checks. Preserve the default-VID versus fixture distinction and the LINK_DOWN/LINK_UP assertions from #97/#98. Run required donor `bash scripts/run_suites.sh` and `bash scripts/lint_hdl.sh`, plus applicable docs/gates; expected exits 0. No count from a skipped scenario.\n4. Review independently under all five parent workflow lenses with two positives, including an external system, then validate the current donor merge result and post-merge containment. A future explicitly selected parent pin must separately pass the complete parent gate and integration bar.\n\n## Dependencies and ownership\n\nExisting parent #400 is the parent integration tracker; #403 shares its authorized bundle. This issue owns only the new PP warning-policy prerequisite. Actual PTOF materialization remains existing PP #61/#83 and parent #70 under #500, with PP #93/#94 prerequisites; it is not duplicated here.\n\nState: Backlog pending scheduling. Scope is settled. Executor and independent reviewers are assigned publicly before takeover; no implementation lane is active. Parent #400/#403 retain their exact-only donor authorization and unmet restore acceptance until a separate public integration decision. Search of all open and closed PP issues found no existing warning-group task.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}